{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本科學家在遠離本土的小笠原羣島發現了一種此前未被正式識別的網蝽新物種。研究人員通過基因組DNA分析發現，過去被認為屬於同一物種的昆蟲，實際上分屬於兩個不同物種。更有意思的是，人類引入的一種外來樹木，可能正在推動當地昆蟲種羣發生新的進化分化。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1585882.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:13:25.474693+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T06:05:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T06:06:50.076418+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:06:50.076418+00:00","content_hash":"f32139913a70dbd6194916f7421ae8d974a3d5e1b7c869d1b63b36869ed999e6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}